      "locked": false,
      "text": "E",
      "fontSize": 39.74574645570688,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "E",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "8p9QU3y7fkj2Z9N16HEU8",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 27.773577397553254,
      "y": 1307.7708864901963,
      "width": 883.4071205982975,
      "height": 71.66665649414048,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b7w",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 382535959,
      "version": 1545,
      "versionNonce": 1402587671,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792311905021,
      "created": 1792311719762,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "其中，s取值为0或者1，用来决定数X的符号，M是一个二进制定点小数，成为数X的尾数，E是一个二进\n制定点整数，称为数X的阶或者指数，R是基数，可以为2，4，16等。计算机中只要表示S,M,E三个信息\n就能确定X的值，这称为浮点数。",
      "fontSize": 19.111108398437462,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "其中，s取值为0或者1，用来决定数X的符号，M是一个二进制定点小数，成为数X的尾数，E是一个二进制定点整数，称为数X的阶或者指数，R是基数，可以为2，4，16等。计算机中只要表示S,M,E三个信息就能确定X的值，这称为浮点数。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "Gdb_kkTRz6T1w9wmXGBjb",
